SUMMARY:Pet Wants 10 Year Anniversary & Pride Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Pet Wants’ 10 year anniversary in South Orange on Saturday\, June 6 at 63 S Orange Ave. Stop by for a fun day of pet-friendly specials\, Pride-themed giveaways\, photo opportunities\, and community celebration. All Day Specials from 9AM–6PM include: $10 self pet washes\, giveaways\, Pride-themed photo ops\, and 10% of all in-store purchase proceeds will be donated to East Orange Animal Alliance. Plus\, don’t miss “Yappy Hour” from 4PM–6PM to enjoy pet fro-yo and mocktails. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
