SUMMARY:Storytelling Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Our Journeys: A Storytelling Workshop\nAs part of the month-long exhibition Our Journeys at the Montclair Public Library\, join us for an interactive workshop that honors intergenerational storytelling\, preserves community voices\, and connects participants through shared reflections. Through photo prompts\, participants of all backgrounds will explore ways to document family journeys and personal histories. A storytelling workbook\, courtesy of Quill Hawk Publishing\, will be given to participants to continue documenting their family stories at home. Free workbook included\, free to participate! \nRSVP HERE https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16878830 \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
