SUMMARY:Heroes For Ghosts (Pink Floyd Tribute Band) live at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Don’t miss the opportunity to witness Pink Floyd classics authentically and lovingly reproduced for your enjoyment by this group of talented local musicians hailing from Montclair\, West Orange\, and The Caldwells. This 8-piece group delivers not just a musical performance\, but an incomparable live show experience. \n$10 cover charge per person that goes directly to the artists. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
