SUMMARY:Tech Talks: Browser Basics
DESCRIPTION:Tech Talks is a free informational series where library staff introduce and explain the technology topics that matter most in today’s digital world. Each session takes a closer look at a new or complex topic—whether it’s a trending app\, an emerging technology\, or a platform you’ve been hearing about but aren’t quite sure how to navigate. Through demonstrations and clear\, jargon-free explanations\, you’ll come away with a better understanding of the tech landscape around you. There’s no hands-on component\, so no devices are needed—just come ready to learn and ask questions. \nAll are welcome regardless of experience level\, and time is reserved at the end of each session for Q&A. Sessions are free and open to the public. \nThis week’s topic is: Browser Basics \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
