SUMMARY:Tech Toolbox: Searching Effectively Online
DESCRIPTION:Tech Toolbox is a free hands-on workshop series focused on building real\, practical digital skills. Each session zeroes in on a specific skill\, program\, or tool—from core computer skills and file management to navigating software and online platforms you use every day. Participants are encouraged to bring their own devices and follow along\, so you’ll leave each session having actually practiced what you learned. \nAll experience levels are welcome\, and your instructor will be there to walk you through everything step by step. Sessions are free and open to the public. \nThis week’s topic is: Searching Effectively Online \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
