SUMMARY:HAVING OUR SAY by Emily Mann
DESCRIPTION:The story of two pioneering sisters who share their family stories\, taking us through a century of American history and sweeping social change\, from slavery to the Civil Rights movement of the 1950s and 60s and beyond. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
